## What this predicate means

**A `is-about-of` B** — A is the primary subject of B (inverse of `about`).  The backlink direction of the strongest topical predicate: a memorial enumerating the memorials whose central concern it IS.

A useful read-side view: "what memorials declare this entity as their primary subject?"  Forms the indegree of the `about:` graph.

